{"title":"훈수 두는 천마님","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=h7CHX/hAC1TNMqjf/muVXLZTmLiGHPof1Zk4hs1&filename=th3","synopsis":"“사부님, 다음 훈수는 뭡니까?!!!”\n\n지구를 덮친 대재앙 [포털 임팩트]로 눈앞에서 부모님을 잃은 주인공 박현수.\n남은 가족이라곤 의식불명 상태인 동생뿐이다. \n동생을 지키기 위해 고군분투하지만 무능력자 서포트인 현수는\n늘 생활고와 사람들의 멸시에 시달리는데….\n그때 나타난 조력자 천경! \n무림에서 현대로 시공간 이동을 한 무림고수 천경이 현수에게 무공을 가르쳐주는…\n\n“제자 놈아….”\n“네, 사부님.”\n\n“라면이나 하나 끓여오거라.”\n“…….”\n\n“한 대 맞고 끓이겠느냐?”\n“그냥 끓이겠습니다.”\n\n―거 맞나???\n아무튼! \n\n비루했던 청년, 천하제일 무공 만렙 고수로 거듭나다. \n고유 능력은 ― ‘훈수 듣기’!!!! \n\nⓒ화봉, 조돌 / 서울미디어코믹스","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":175,"change":{"type":"up","amount":51}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":228,"change":{"type":"down","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":238,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":221,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":248,"change":{"type":"down","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":239,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":236,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":243,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":244,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":222,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":252,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":213,"change":{"type":"up","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":251,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":259,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":254,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":277,"change":{"type":"down","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":278,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":232,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":224,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"20